# The Languages bar on the repository page is Go's, in full. Everything else
# in this repository is documentation, configuration, assets or tooling —
# none of it is a language the project is written in, so none of it belongs
# in the metric. linguist-documentation and linguist-vendored both exclude a
# file from the language statistics.
#
# Verify with: https://github.com/angelnicolasc/graymatter (Languages section)
# after any push that adds a new file type.

# Documentation.
*.md            linguist-documentation
*.mdx           linguist-documentation

# Configuration, manifests, machine-readable docs.
*.json          linguist-vendored
*.jsonl         linguist-vendored
*.jsonc         linguist-vendored
*.yml           linguist-vendored
*.yaml          linguist-vendored
*.toml          linguist-vendored
*.mod           linguist-vendored
*.sum           linguist-vendored

# Tooling and site assets.
*.sh            linguist-vendored
*.css           linguist-vendored
*.mjs           linguist-vendored
Dockerfile      linguist-vendored
Dockerfile.*    linguist-vendored
